{"mode":"words","text":"Högst upp ser du en text precis som appen visar den för dig. Varje ord är ett litet kort: högst upp står ordet på målspråket, och under det dess betydelse på ditt modersmål – ord för ord, i målspråkets ordning. Under det står hela meningen översatt i ett sammanhängande flöde. För språk med ett annat skriftsystem läggs en rad med transkription till, så att du kan läsa allt. Tryck på ett ord: rösten fortsätter att spelas upp precis därifrån.","words":[{"s":0,"e":337},{"s":383,"e":476},{"s":534,"e":708},{"s":731,"e":789},{"s":848,"e":894},{"s":964,"e":1358},{"s":1428,"e":1800},{"s":1834,"e":1962},{"s":2043,"e":2322},{"s":2368,"e":2682},{"s":2705,"e":2810},{"s":2856,"e":2949},{"s":2995,"e":3367},{"s":3704,"e":4075},{"s":4214,"e":4481},{"s":4563,"e":4690},{"s":4737,"e":4818},{"s":4981,"e":5387},{"s":5468,"e":6130},{"s":6594,"e":6931},{"s":6978,"e":7082},{"s":7140,"e":7361},{"s":7442,"e":7779},{"s":7825,"e":7906},{"s":7964,"e":8975},{"s":9265,"e":9369},{"s":9427,"e":9694},{"s":9729,"e":9950},{"s":9973,"e":10147},{"s":10217,"e":10832},{"s":10879,"e":10948},{"s":10995,"e":11134},{"s":11215,"e":11970},{"s":12016,"e":12040},{"s":12063,"e":12307},{"s":12365,"e":12492},{"s":12574,"e":12887},{"s":13108,"e":13177},{"s":13247,"e":13944},{"s":14025,"e":14547},{"s":15279,"e":15546},{"s":15581,"e":15801},{"s":15848,"e":16045},{"s":16080,"e":16277},{"s":16335,"e":16811},{"s":16893,"e":17334},{"s":17415,"e":17450},{"s":17473,"e":17566},{"s":17636,"e":18332},{"s":18367,"e":19017},{"s":19354,"e":19482},{"s":19505,"e":19934},{"s":20004,"e":20085},{"s":20120,"e":20190},{"s":20260,"e":20492},{"s":20515,"e":21328},{"s":21397,"e":21653},{"s":21734,"e":21850},{"s":21943,"e":22222},{"s":22268,"e":22361},{"s":22384,"e":23081},{"s":23162,"e":23673},{"s":23859,"e":23951},{"s":23998,"e":24068},{"s":24091,"e":24160},{"s":24219,"e":24323},{"s":24369,"e":24625},{"s":24706,"e":25287},{"s":25821,"e":26076},{"s":26134,"e":26204},{"s":26239,"e":26308},{"s":26436,"e":26819},{"s":269